  "body": "More Space. More Flexibility. More to Love.\r\nLooking for a home with room for the whole family? Set on a 517sqm (approx.) corner site with an impressive 255sqm (approx.) floor area, this substantial home offers space, comfort and versatility in the heart of Orewa.\r\n\r\nTWO MASTER SUITES. ROOM FOR EVERYONE.\r\nFeaturing four generously sized bedrooms, including two spacious master bedrooms with their own ensuites, this home offers plenty of room for families to spread out and enjoy their own space. A separate study provides added flexibility for working from home or extra storage.\r\n\r\nTWO KITCHENS. MORE WAYS TO ENTERTAIN.\r\nThe modern open-plan kitchen is perfect for everyday family living, while the additional butler’s kitchen provides extra space for food preparation and entertaining. A spacious walk-in laundry adds further practicality.\r\n\r\nSPACE INSIDE. FREEDOM OUTSIDE.\r\nEnjoy the sun-drenched corner site, landscaped garden and deck with great indoor-outdoor flow. With separate entrances to both levels, the home also offers flexibility for extended family living or a variety of lifestyle needs.\r\n\r\nPARKING MADE EASY.\r\nA double internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking provides plenty of room for family vehicles and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nA GREAT LOCATION IN OREWA.\r\nSurrounded by quality homes and conveniently located near local amenities, shops, schools and motorway access, this is an opportunity to enjoy spacious living in a sought-after coastal community.\r\n\r\nWith the balance of the 10-year Master Build Guarantee, you can enjoy added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nMore space, more flexibility and so much potential to make it your own.\r\n\r\nContact Ivy & Eddie today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
